{
  "_comment": [
    "Ignition (Flatcar, Fedora CoreOS). JSON, so this merges structurally: objects key",
    "by key, arrays replaced rather than appended.",
    "",
    "Author it in Butane and transpile, rather than writing Ignition by hand:",
    "  butane --pretty --strict < node.bu > flatcar-node.ign",
    "then add the `members` or `match` key to the result.",
    "",
    "`members` and `match` are this server's keys and are stripped before serving."
  ],
  "members": ["52:54:00:89:d8:10"],

  "ignition": { "version": "3.4.0" },
  "passwd": {
    "users": [
      {
        "name": "core",
        "sshAuthorizedKeys": ["ssh-ed25519 AAAA...REPLACE ops@example.com"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "storage": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "/etc/hostname",
        "mode": 420,
        "overwrite": true,
        "contents": { "source": "data:,flatcar-node%0A" }
      }
    ]
  }
}
